{"seq":2,"slug":"locality-hit-ratio","title":"局部性与命中率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/foundations/locality-hit-ratio","wordCount":1606,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"局部性与命中率\">局部性与命中率</h1><p>缓存之所以有效，不是因为内存比磁盘快——那只是物理前提；真正让缓存「值得存在」的，是程序访问数据时呈现出的强烈规律性：刚访问过的东西很快会再被访问，访问了某个东西大概率也会访问它旁边的东西。这种规律叫「局部性（locality）」。没有局部性，缓存只是一块永远猜不中的内存；有了局部性，一小块缓存就能拦下绝大多数请求。本文先讲清局部性的种类，再把「拦下多少」量化成命中率，最后给出命中率的理论上界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>局部性分两种基本形态，它们对应缓存设计中两个不同的取舍维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[访问局部性] --&gt; B[时间局部性&lt;br/&gt;刚访问的很快再访问]&#10;  A --&gt; C[空间局部性&lt;br/&gt;访问了 X 也会访问 X 邻近]&#10;  B --&gt; D[偏向保留最近项&lt;br/&gt;LRU 类策略]&#10;  C --&gt; E[偏向预取/批量加载&lt;br/&gt;按行/按页/按前缀]&#10;  B --&gt; F[热点分布&lt;br/&gt;少数 key 占多数流量]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Zipf 分布]\">flowchart TD\n  A[访问局部性] --&gt; B[时间局部性&lt;br/&gt;刚访问的很快再访问]\n  A --&gt; C[空间局部性&lt;br/&gt;访问了 X 也会访问 X 邻近]\n  B --&gt; D[偏向保留最近项&lt;br/&gt;LRU 类策略]\n  C --&gt; E[偏向预取/批量加载&lt;br/&gt;按行/按页/按前缀]\n  B --&gt; F[热点分布&lt;br/&gt;少数 key 占多数流量]\n  F --&gt; G[Zipf 分布]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局部性类型</th>\n<th>直觉描述</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n<th>利用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间局部性</td>\n<td>最近用过的还会用</td>\n<td>热门商品详情被反复读</td>\n<td>优先保留最近访问项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间局部性</td>\n<td>用了这个会用旁边的</td>\n<td>翻页时连续加载相邻记录</td>\n<td>预取、批量加载、按页缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布偏斜</td>\n<td>少数键占多数流量</td>\n<td>头部 1% 商品占 50% 访问</td>\n<td>只缓存热点即可高命中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间局部性是淘汰策略的立身之本：因为「最近用过的更可能再用」，所以 <a href=\"../eviction-expiry/eviction-policies\">淘汰策略</a> 中的 LRU 才把最久未用的踢出去。空间局部性则指导「一次缓存多少」——按页、按前缀批量加载，能让一次回源摊薄到多次命中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中率的定义与度量\">命中率的定义与度量</h2><p>命中率（hit ratio）是缓存价值的核心指标，定义为命中次数占总请求的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\frac{N_{hit}}{N_{hit} + N_{miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与之配套的两个量是未命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = 1 - h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 和回源率（origin load factor）。后者直接决定后端压力：若命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span>，则只有 5% 的请求落到数据库，后端负载降为原来的 1/20。这正是 <a href=\"caching-fundamentals\">缓存原理与价值</a> 中「用更小的数据库扛十倍流量」的算术依据。</p>\n<p>度量命中率有几个易踩的坑。其一，要区分<strong>请求命中率（按次数）<strong>与</strong>字节命中率（按数据量）</strong>——CDN 场景下一个大文件命中，省下的带宽远超一个小文件，<a href=\"../advanced/cdn-edge-caching\">CDN 与边缘缓存</a> 因此更看重字节命中率。其二，<strong>冷启动期</strong>的命中率天然偏低，统计窗口要避开缓存刚预热的阶段。其三，要警惕「假命中」——若 TTL 设置过长，命中的可能是早已陈旧的数据，命中率高但正确率低，这把矛盾留给 <a href=\"../eviction-expiry/consistency-staleness\">一致性与陈旧度</a> 处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热点分布-为什么小缓存也能高命中\">热点分布：为什么小缓存也能高命中</h2><p>真实世界的访问极少是均匀的，绝大多数遵循 Zipf 分布：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 热门的对象，其访问频率近似与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{-\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 常在 0.7–1.2 之间）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(k) \\propto \\frac{1}{k^{\\alpha}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个幂律意味着头部极少数对象贡献了绝大部分流量——所谓「二八定律」的数学本体。它带来一个极具实践价值的结论：只需缓存住头部那一小撮热点，就能用很小的内存换来很高的命中率。例如当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，缓存前 1% 的对象常能命中 50% 以上的请求。这也是为什么「缓存不必装下全部数据」——盲目追求全量缓存既浪费内存，又拉低了热点项的留存机会。</p>\n<p>但 Zipf 也埋了陷阱：头部那几个超级热点 key 一旦集中失效，会瞬间把巨量流量打到后端，这就是 <a href=\"../advanced/cache-failures\">缓存穿透击穿雪崩</a> 中「击穿」的成因。热点越集中，单点失效的破坏力越大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中率的理论上界-belady-最优\">命中率的理论上界：Belady 最优</h2><p>命中率能做到多高，存在一个不可逾越的天花板。1966 年 Belady 提出的 OPT（也称 MIN）算法给出了答案：每次淘汰时，踢掉「未来最久才会被再次访问」的那一项。OPT 是离线最优——它需要预知未来访问序列，现实中不可实现，但它定义了任何在线策略的命中率上限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>是否需要预知未来</th>\n<th>命中率定位</th>\n<th>现实可用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OPT（Belady）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>理论上界</td>\n<td>否，仅作基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LRU</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>接近 OPT（强时间局部性下）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFU</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>接近 OPT（强偏斜下）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机淘汰</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>下界参照</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OPT 的意义在于评估：拿一份生产流量回放，分别跑 OPT 和你的在线策略，二者命中率的差距就是你「还能优化多少」的空间。若差距已很小，再换算法收益有限，更该去扩容或调 TTL。现代高级策略如 W-TinyLFU 的设计目标，正是在不预知未来的前提下尽量逼近 OPT，细节见 <a href=\"../eviction-expiry/eviction-policies\">淘汰策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中率工程-三条提升路径\">命中率工程：三条提升路径</h2><p>提升命中率不止「换个算法」一条路。第一条是<strong>扩大缓存容量</strong>——容量越大，能容纳的工作集（working set，即一段时间内被反复访问的对象集合）越完整，但收益随容量增长递减（命中率曲线是凹的）。第二条是<strong>优化淘汰策略</strong>，让有限容量优先留住高价值对象。第三条常被忽视：<strong>优化 key 的设计与粒度</strong>。过细的 key（如把可复用的查询拆成无数个性化 key）会让重复度暴跌、命中率崩盘；合理的 key 归并能显著提高复用。这与 <a href=\"cache-patterns\">缓存读写模式</a> 中如何组织缓存写入紧密相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>局部性是缓存有效的根本前提：时间局部性支撑淘汰策略，空间局部性支撑预取与批量加载。</li>\n<li>命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = N_{hit}/(N_{hit}+N_{miss})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接决定后端负载，度量时要区分请求命中率与字节命中率，并警惕冷启动与假命中。</li>\n<li>真实访问呈 Zipf 幂律分布，头部极少数热点占据多数流量，所以小缓存也能高命中——但热点集中也放大了单点失效的破坏力。</li>\n<li>Belady OPT 给出命中率的理论上界，是评估在线策略「还差多少」的基准。</li>\n<li>提升命中率有扩容、换策略、优化 key 粒度三条路径，且容量收益递减，需结合具体工作集权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"局部性与命中率","id":"局部性与命中率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"命中率的定义与度量","id":"命中率的定义与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"热点分布：为什么小缓存也能高命中","id":"热点分布-为什么小缓存也能高命中"},{"level":2,"text":"命中率的理论上界：Belady 最优","id":"命中率的理论上界-belady-最优"},{"level":2,"text":"命中率工程：三条提升路径","id":"命中率工程-三条提升路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存原理与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/foundations/caching-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"缓存读写模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/foundations/cache-patterns"}}